# docs/PICT_CENSUS.md § S7 — createQuestion (#1186)
# lib/questions/server.ts:45 — six-outcome error taxonomy (5 errors + success), precedence:
# schema validation -> course existence -> primary topic existence/non-deleted -> exact
# self-duplicate -> secondary topic existence/non-deleted (folded) -> success.
Validity:          valid, invalid
Course:            exists, missing
PrimaryTopic:      exists, missing, deleted
SecondaryTopicIds: none, valid, duplicate-primary, all-missing, all-deleted, mixed-missing-and-deleted
Type:              MCQ, SA, LA
